😿", "content_rendered": "<p>如题：看了 V 友的评论，大多都是 100w 太少了不够躺平、至少得 4-500w 才够、blablabla...</p>\n<p>看到这些我想说的是，现在大环境有目共睹，随时都有可能被优化。一个普通人能攒够 100w 已经很了不起了。如果 V 友们都是年入百万并且工作稳定，对不起，我没资格发言😿</p>\n", "last_modified": 1785287413, "replies": 78, "id": 1230580}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3c59/dc04/21_large.png?m=1650127623", "name": "shenzhen", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3c59/dc04/21_normal.png?m=1650127623", "title": "深圳", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/shenzhen", "topics": 3581, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Shenzhen", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/3c59/dc04/21_mini.png?m=1650127623", "stars": 2138, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 21, "parent_node_name": "cn"}, "member": {"id": 698558, "username": "Bullish", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Bullish", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_mini.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_normal.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_large.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bac/e0c3/698558_xxxlarge.png?m=1760142421", "created": 1719575876, "last_modified": 1760142421, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "tyhunter", "last_touched": 1785320190, "title": "深圳灵活就业社保费用一直涨，都快坚持不住了。", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230577", "created": 1785285819, "deleted": 0, "content": "自费交了几年灵活就业社保了，记的刚开始交灵活就业社保时每个月还不到一千块。现在每个月是 1493.64 元（ 不知道后续还会不会继续涨 ），有时候想停交养老险，只交医疗保险（ 深圳的灵活就业社保是可以单独交的，没有绑定 ）。\r\n\r\n但是看缴费记录都已经累积 13 年了（ 本人九零后 ），到了一个比较尴尬的点，停了有点可惜，继续交不知道后面政策怎么变化，目前收入又断了，有点子坚持不住。", "content_rendered": "自费交了几年灵活就业社保了，记的刚开始交灵活就业社保时每个月还不到一千块。现在每个月是 1493.64 元（ 不知道后续还会不会继续涨 ），有时候想停交养老险，只交医疗保险（ 深圳的灵活就业社保是可以单独交的，没有绑定 ）。<br /><br />但是看缴费记录都已经累积 13 年了（ 本人九零后 ），到了一个比较尴尬的点，停了有点可惜，继续交不知道后面政策怎么变化，目前收入又断了，有点子坚持不住。", "last_modified": 1785285819, "replies": 69, "id": 1230577}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 240339, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4503, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 293364, "username": "JaneHan", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/JaneHan", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3c1/b510/293364_mini.png?m=1767493260", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3c1/b510/293364_normal.png?m=1767493260", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3c1/b510/293364_large.png?m=1767493260", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3c1/b510/293364_xlarge.png?m=1767493260", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3c1/b510/293364_xxlarge.png?m=1767493260", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f3c1/b510/293364_xxxlarge.png?m=1767493260", "created": 1519349169, "last_modified": 1767493260, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "arvinwangzj", "last_touched": 1785320257, "title": "现在的我们，手里有多少钱，才有资格躺平？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230598", "created": 1785291149, "deleted": 0, "content": "最近刷到 v 友说有 100w 是否可以躺平？大环境下，一份稳定的工作已经很难得了，能攒下钱的朋友是真的很厉害。\r\n\r\n现在环境下的我们手里到底有多少钱，才能可以躺平？\r\n\r\n在这种环境下，我们怎么能攒下钱？", "content_rendered": "<p>最近刷到 v 友说有 100w 是否可以躺平？大环境下，一份稳定的工作已经很难得了，能攒下钱的朋友是真的很厉害。</p>\n<p>现在环境下的我们手里到底有多少钱，才能可以躺